WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.020
Hiiragi!

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.610
Hiiragi!

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.440
Iwatooshi!

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.200
Damn it... Damn it!

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.540
Come on, heart, move!

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.540
Hiiragi!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.010
Hiiragi!

