00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.620
<b>Nono
Hiiragi</b>

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.290
<b>Matobai
Shuusaku</b>

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.410
<b>Arabashiri
Souya</b>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.870
<b>Tsuwabuki
Akihito</b>

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.080
<b>Hazama
Zetsubi</b>

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.210
<b>Banryuu
Reoko</b>

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.500
<b>Tsuwabuki
Akihito</b>

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.500
<b>Matobai
Shuusaku</b>

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.500
<b>Banryuu
Reoko</b>

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.500
<b>Arabashiri
Souya</b>

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.500
<b>Hazama
Zetsubi</b>

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.010
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:06.930
Hiiragi! Wake up, Hiiragi!

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.830
To offer one's own body 
to protect the heart...

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:16.300
This boy's attitude, and his Bubuki, 
trying to protect its master...

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.530
He may be an enemy,
but I have to respect him.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.680
Conversely, what of you?

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:29.510
Will you only stand there, 
protecting none but yourself?

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.250
You coward!

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.340
Azuma... Run...

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:49.480
Are you even worth the protection 
of a man such as him?

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:55.110
Well, no matter. I'm taking 
the heart, and that's all.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.190
For Epizo!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.940
Stop!

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:07.600
From here on, I, the leader, 
will finish this fight.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.580
Epizo, your unbeating heart

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.820
is of no use in battle.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.500
This one fist is all I need.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.130
Right, Azuma?

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:23.510
Gianna!

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.760
<i>Roger that!</i>

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.850
Sh-She's gone?

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:34.190
Up there!

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.230
When did she...

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.620
What did Sensei say?

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.080
Wh-Why should we tell you?

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.910
Tell me.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:57.690
Hmph! Fine, listen and lose 
all hope, then! Ready?

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:01.840
Tsuwabuki-sensei doesn't even 
think of you as a human!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.640
Tsuwabuki-sensei said so.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.550
That you're not a human, but a stone.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:11.230
That's right! He did! He called you a rock!

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.180
He said I'm... a stone?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.720
Of course, right?

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:25.930
It must be a shock to have 
Tsuwabuki-sensei call you a rock.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.240
A big, big, big shock!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.910
I wouldn't get out of bed for three days!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.830
Stone, human...

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.980
Stone, human...

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.120
Stone, human...

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:46.680
Stone, human... Stone, 
human... Stone, human...

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.500
What's with her? Talk about creepy.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.440
Gianna, bash her head in this time!

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.460
Gianna!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.390
What the hell are you?!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.480
I am a stone.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.000
Stop talking nonsense!

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:11.070
I-Is all of this... her Rinzu?

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.830
If she attacked with that...

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.330
There wouldn't be a
single bone fragment left!

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.880
I will polish myself.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:27.380
And I will become an one-of-a-kind stone.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:35.100
What in the world is that girl?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.260
Thank you.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.110
My head feels lighter.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.490
So I'll let you go.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.870
Don't you make a fool of me!

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:54.010
Boom.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.880
Sheesh...

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.260
I thought I was a goner.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.480
Lyudmila, are you okay?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.310
Hey... Lyudmila?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.730
I couldn't even make a move.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.570
You couldn't help that.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:29.280
I'd never seen such an insane 
amount of Rinzu before, either.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.690
You're lucky just to be alive.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.520
Zvezdochka!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:43.470
It's all right. The core isn't broken.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.380
Zvezdochka can regenerate.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.090
Oh, yeah... You're right...

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:52.780
But when our elder brother 
sees this, he'll scold me.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:56.660
Our elder brother wouldn't get 
angry over something like this.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:01.480
His heart is filled with a love 
deeper than Lake Baikal, you know.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.250
Really?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:08.330
Really. So let's head back for today.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.280
Okay.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.760
What's wrong, Azuma?  Try to hit me more!

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:27.680
Then I'll just go after you!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.550
You...

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:37.080
Yes, Azuma! That's it!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.640
You're a heart user, like me.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.820
It doesn't matter how clumsy you are.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.890
Just show me your heart!

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.900
Now you're getting there.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.120
Same to you!

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:05.630
A heart that can't take a few hits 
isn't even worth laughing at!

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.630
What the heck is this?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.640
This is what they call "letting 
your fists do the talking."

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.580
Epizo, that heart you have...

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.590
Azuma, some things are best left unsaid.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.960
I saw your past.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:55.310
Mine?

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:56.220
Yeah.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:01.560
And, I mean.... I guess you've 
been through a lot, too, but...

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:03.590
Let's both give it our best.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:04.850
Bye.

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.040
Hey!

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.020
What's going on, Epizo?

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.830
We're backing off, Luis, Ouargla.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.440
What?!

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:15.560
Hold it! What about the heart?

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.020
Are you going to ignore 
Monsieur Guy's orders?

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:26.780
I want to make my own heart beat.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:28.740
I'm going to find a way to do that.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:34.290
Fine. Call back Farrah and Domina.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.740
Thanks, Luis.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:50.020
<b>Episode 9
Fist Against Fist</b>

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.070
Forgive me, Zetsubi.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.640
I'm not worthy of your apology.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:03.830
But, Reoko-sama, please... 
Please take care of yourself.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:08.120
This is the one thing I ask of you.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.020
Yeah, I will.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.790
I should apologize to all of you, too.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.190
You, too, Shuusaku.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.190
Where have you been?

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.180
Sorry. It was nothing.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.580
Is that...

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:29.690
It's the real heart of the headless Buranki.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.530
The real heart?

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:34.220
Then the one they took was...

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:39.330
A fake that I had wrapped up 
in a thin membrane of Rinzu.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:42.420
It must have looked perfectly 
real at a glance

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:45.010
to those yellow-billed baby chicks.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:51.170
As they say, the older, the wiser!

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:54.330
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:58.000
But in exchange, if you 
could put it that way,

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.370
I have a more troubling matter 
of which to inform you.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.140
What is it?

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:05.330
It's about the limbs we took 
from the headless Buranki.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:08.600
So common hands and feet 
were a poor fit for Entei?

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:14.940
Very well. Then our next move is decided.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.120
He passed out, the minute he got back.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.370
Hii-kun must've really been exhausted.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:31.370
Hiiragi used up all his Rinzu to protect me.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.960
You should rest, too, A-chan.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.040
You look pale.

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:41.210
Thanks, but I'll stay here for now.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:47.690
I think you might be trying 
a little too hard, A-chan.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:49.890
Don't overdo it, okay?

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.060
We'll work hard, too.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.140
Thanks, Kogane-chan.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.460
What is it now?

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.030
Huh?!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.450
Whoa! The train dove into the ocean!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.790
Kino-chan! Kino-chan!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.960
How is the train running underwater?!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.590
Oh, Kogane?

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:19.320
Apparently the whole train is enveloped 
in Rinzu that's being amplified by Oubu.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.970
We're lucky Shizuru is 
so good with machines.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:25.390
I see! So that's why we're 
not losing any air!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:29.350
Now it's a straight shot from 
here to Treasure Island.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.140
How's Hiiragi?

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.620
He's still asleep.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.210
But A-chan is with him now.

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.020
Oh, he'll be fine.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.030
Besides, it's best he sleeps 
while he has the chance.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.570
We don't know when those 
weirdos will attack us again.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:46.640
Yeah.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.950
I see, I see.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.870
So after depleting all of your own strength,

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:00.090
Now, now, Epizo, 
there's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:03.660
Now, now, Epizo, 
there's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:04.600
Huh?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.720
You truly did a fine job!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.300
R-Right...

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:14.930
We must do away with all the unsightly 
Buranki that threaten our world.

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:16.230
Y-Yes, sir...

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:24.060
To do that, I need your talent for making 
that Buranki of yours serve us.

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:29.030
Only a Buranki can defeat another Buranki.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.660
Only a Buranki! Yes!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:36.570
Come to think of it, I heard Monsieur Guy 
comes from a line of heart users himself.

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:37.840
So I heard.

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.920
Really? Really? Really?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.630
Why doesn't he fight them himself, then?

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:46.680
The people at the top have their 
own reasons for everything.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.320
Now then, Epizo...

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.440
Do you know when wine came to exist?

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:53.810
<i>Gulp...</i>

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:56.470
Wine is known as mankind's 
oldest alcoholic beverage.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:57.140
<i>Am I... being scolded?</i>

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:57.940
It was recorded—

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.820
Huh... A failure.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:08.200
Now the revival of our Buranki, Zanpaza, 
has further escaped our grasp.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.950
How dare you two bring shame 
upon our elder brother?!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.200
Die! Die right now in apology!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.930
Stop it, Lyudmila.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.810
In this cramped submarine,

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.530
just breathing the same air as 
the mice is agonizing enough.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:26.670
Do you want to dirty the place further 
with the blood of these mice?

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:30.140
I'm so sorry, Elder Brother!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.810
Lyudmila, Gianna...

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:33.890
What about you two?

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.430
Can you obtain the heart?

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.940
Of course!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.560
You can count on us, Elder Brother!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.120
Shizuru, was it?

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:46.070
Can you swear you won't let her 
get the jump on you again?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.320
We most certainly can!

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:53.400
I swear upon your eyes,
which shine deep red, like alexandrite,

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:56.110
that we'll crush that little 
rock girl into dust!

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:58.330
We'll crush her into dust, 
then crush her dust

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.920
into dust, then crush that into diamond dust,

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.090
and then scatter her 
all over the ice fields!

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.370
Very well. I'm counting on you.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.340
Yes, Elder Brother!

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:09.610
Take the mice with you.

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.510
They may serve as shields, at least.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.850
Yes, Elder Brother!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.580
Oh, good. You're awake.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.080
Gross. How long have you been here?

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.550
Sounds like you're gonna be just fine.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.610
You're overreacting. This is nothing.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.540
What's going on? Are we in the ocean?

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:41.030
Yeah. The train's being protected by Rinzu.

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:44.540
Rinzu? I swear, anything 
goes with this thing.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:48.220
But that means we're finally getting 
close to Treasure Island, huh?

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:51.860
I can't sit around— Ow...

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.890
Damn that boomerang brat.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.310
I'm gonna kill him next time I see him.

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:00.920
What? What's so funny?

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.480
Why did you protect me?

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.940
Hell, who knows?

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.320
I was planning to take the heart from you

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.530
long before I even met you.

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:19.340
I didn't want to live my life at the 
mercy of the heart, like my dad did.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:23.300
So I wanted to be the heart, 
not a hand or foot.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:26.250
But I don't care about that now.

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:29.270
I'm fine with being one of the limbs.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:33.440
I'll be a limb that runs 
alongside the heart.

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:37.480
As I watched you keep running forward, 
even though you're a heart,

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:40.520
I started to think that at some point.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.970
So there you have it.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:13.130
So this is the end of the line, 
Treasure Island Station?

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:16.010
Anyone can see it's just a ruin!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.890
You're right. There are 
even holes in the ceiling.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:20.560
Come on!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.520
How are we supposed to get 
to Treasure Island from here?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.920
Rock girl! We're here to take your heart!

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:37.340
Zvezdochka has regenerated,
and it's itching to suck your blood!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.560
Still nothing...

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:53.070
Iwatooshi!

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:56.180
I'll tear you to pieces!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.800
Righty-chan!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.220
Himekiri! Hoemaru!

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.810
Let us go, you freak!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:07.310
I won't let you get in Lyudmila-sama 
and Gianna-sama's way.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:08.600
Damn!

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.030
You're my prey!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:13.730
No, she's mine!

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:19.910
What the hell...

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.990
...are you?!

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.110
<i>You're a heart user, like me.</i>

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:36.140
<i>It doesn't matter how clumsy you are.</i>

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.230
<i>Just show me your heart!</i>

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:41.510
<i>I'll be a limb that runs 
alongside the heart.</i>

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.520
Lyudmila-sama! Gianna-sama!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:53.320
N-Not bad, Shizuru-san...

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:57.470
From now on, you're not Shizuru-chan! 
You're Super Shizuru-san!

00:18:58.470 --> 00:18:59.490
Azuma!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.410
A-chan!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.330
Azuma!

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:02.200
Azuma...

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.510
A-chan, are you okay now?

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.470
Finally back to life, huh?

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:11.040
You're gonna have to work hard to make 
up for skipping out on us, Heart-sama.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.790
Yeah.

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:19.570
The right hand, the left hand, 
the right foot, and the left foot...

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:25.560
As the heart, I'll take on all of 
their pain, fear, and sadness myself.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.910
So start moving, heart!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:40.010
Damn it!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:41.150
Damn it!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.960
Damn it! Damn it!

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.180
That's enough, A-chan.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.250
Don't try so hard by yourself anymore.

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.900
You have all of us by your side.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:20:00.450
It makes us sad when you try to do it alone.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.260
Let me work hard with you.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:04.860
Kogane-chan...

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.100
She's right, Azuma.

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:14.360
You don't have to try so hard 
to act like a heart should.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.540
Just be the kind of heart 
that only you can be.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.850
There's no point in a heart all by itself.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:26.090
We've got all four limbs, plus the heart.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.490
That's how we can all run 
forward together, right?

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:32.080
I agree with my right and left.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.100
That's taking it too far!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.100
For the ten years since I 
fell from Treasure Island,

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:44.340
I searched for Oubu so I could 
make it back there one day.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:50.350
So that day, when I met all of you 
and rode Oubu, I was so happy.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.850
Azuma, you...

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:57.860
But today is the happiest day of my life.

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:00.230
Thank you all.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.070
A-chan...

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.910
Move, heart!

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.410
Together with everyone!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:40.610
Could this be...

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.210
Oubu's true form?

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:52.830
We did it! We turned into the true Oubu!

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:55.530
The Buranki, Oubu!

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.460
What's this?

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:04.400
You've gotten much more impressive 
since the last time I saw you.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:07.090
But if you get too cocky,

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:09.110
you'll get burned.
